        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "357DB497166230DE",
      "text": "我駭進了[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的手機，\\n來進行這個通話。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "legend_0015_select_01",
      "hash64": "AECA47BE2224E1A2",
      "text": "你是誰？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "legend_0015_select_02",
      "hash64": "AECA46BE2224DFEF",
      "text": "駭進我的手機？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "357DB59716623291",
      "text": "駭進[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的手機，換句話說……\\n我暫時掌控了[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的手機。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "357DB69716623444",
      "text": "我的名字叫做仙后。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "357DB797166235F7",
      "text": "……我知道[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳這個人。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是個資質出色的寶可夢訓練家。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_06",
      "hash64": "357DB897166237AA",
      "text": "我很欣賞[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的本事，\\n有事情想拜託[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_07",
      "hash64": "357DB9971662395D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]……\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳應該知道天星隊吧？[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_14",
      "hash64": "35813C9716654DCD",
      "text": "……說謊並不可取。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳應該已經見過天星隊了。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_15",
      "hash64": "35813B9716654C1A",
      "text": "……很高興我不需要多做說明。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_08",
      "hash64": "357DAA9716621FE0",
      "text": "天星隊由學院的學生們組成……\\n也就是所謂的不良分子集團。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_09",
      "hash64": "357DAB9716622193",
      "text": "他們破壞學院的風紀，\\n給周圍帶來麻煩。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_10",
      "hash64": "3581389716654701",
      "text": "我無法放任這群人不管……！[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_11",
      "hash64": "358137971665454E",
      "text": "所以我正在思考讓天星隊解散，\\n把他們打散成小星星的計畫……\\r\\n這個計畫就叫做星塵大作戰。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_12",
      "hash64": "358136971665439B",
      "text": "這個計畫需要志同道合的人……\\n希望[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也能助我一臂之力。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "legend_0015_cassiopeia_13",
      "hash64": "35813597166541E8",
      "text": "……[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不用立刻回答，\\n細節我們之後再談。\\r\\n今天就先說到這裡。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
